src/PaPiMeLa.Platform.PipeWire.pas contains translations of inline functions from
the PipeWire headers (spa/utils, spa/pod, spa/param/audio, pipewire/core.h,
pipewire/node.h; PipeWire 1.6.2). That part is also subject to the following
license.
src/PaPiMeLa.Platform.PipeWire.pas は PipeWire のヘッダのインライン関数の翻訳を含みます。
